    words which don't look even slightly believable. If you are going to use a passage
    of Lorem Ipsum, you need to be sure there isn't anything embarrassing hidden
    in the middle of text. All the Lorem Ipsum generators on the Internet tend to
    repeat predefined chunks as necessary, making this the first true generator on
    the Internet. It uses a dictionary of over 200 Latin words, combined with a handful
    of model sentence structures, to generate Lorem Ipsum which looks reasonable.
    The generated Lorem Ipsum is therefore always free from repetition, injected
    humour, or non-characteristic words etc.
